WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:12.883
Tina: How do you know all this?

2
00:00:12.884 --> 00:00:15.207
Hopian: Tristay told me.

3
00:00:15.208 --> 00:00:19.446
All three: Tristay told you? How? When?

4
00:00:19.447 --> 00:00:23.290
Hopian: It was soon after things started to turn gray.

5
00:00:23.291 --> 00:00:26.050
Hopian: Tristay came to see me.

6
00:00:26.051 --> 00:00:29.380
I almost didn’t recognize him.

7
00:00:29.381 --> 00:00:32.188
Hopian: He showed me his new power.

8
00:00:32.189 --> 00:00:36.503
Hopian: He said that he would change Ginormous forever.

9
00:00:36.504 --> 00:00:43.185
Hopian: It was horrible to see someone so evil!

10
00:00:43.186 --> 00:00:45.639
Danny: I want to stop this guy!

11
00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:47.211
Tina: Me too!

12
00:00:47.212 --> 00:00:49.054
Brad: I’m ready!

13
00:00:49.055 --> 00:00:51.794
Tina: So what’s our first step?

14
00:00:51.795 --> 00:00:57.115
Danny: We started our adventure with blue, so let’s start with blue here.

15
00:00:57.116 --> 00:01:00.359
Tina: We could put the blue back in the ocean.

16
00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:05.467
Hopian: That’s an excellent idea.

17
00:01:05.468 --> 00:01:08.431
Danny: Okay. Is everybody ready?

18
00:01:08.432 --> 00:01:10.450
Hopian: You three go on ahead.

19
00:01:10.451 --> 00:01:15.356
Hopian: I must take Bello to his grandparents', where he will be safe.

20
00:01:15.357 --> 00:01:17.869
Danny: We might need your help, Hopian.

21
00:01:17.870 --> 00:01:21.570
Hopian: I’ll be there soon.

22
00:01:21.571 --> 00:01:22.969
Brad: Wait!

23
00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:24.366
Danny: What?

24
00:01:24.367 --> 00:01:27.792
Brad: How do we get to the ocean?

25
00:01:27.793 --> 00:01:31.930
Hopian: Follow the little bug.

26
00:01:31.931 --> 00:01:33.518
Tina: There it is!

27
00:01:33.519 --> 00:01:37.954
Danny: Which way to the ocean?

28
00:01:37.955 --> 00:01:39.544
Hopian: Be careful!

29
00:01:39.545 --> 00:01:47.403
All three: Bye!

30
00:01:47.404 --> 00:01:51.399
Hopian: Bello, it’s time to get up. Wake up.

31
00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:56.082
Hopian: We have to go to your grandparents' house.

32
00:01:56.083 --> 00:02:01.910
Hopian: Bello?

33
00:02:01.911 --> 00:02:11.802
Hopian: Bello? Where did he go?

34
00:02:11.803 --> 00:02:17.759
Hopian: Bello! Bello! BELLLOOO!

35
00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:22.816
Tina: I think I see the ocean, just past those hills.

36
00:02:22.817 --> 00:02:30.778
Danny: Thank you, bug. You can go back to Hopian now.

37
00:02:30.779 --> 00:02:33.392
Brad: Are we there yet?

38
00:02:33.393 --> 00:02:38.393
Danny: Guys, it sounds like something is following us!

39
00:02:38.394 --> 00:02:42.387
Brad: Quick, let’s hide behind this rock.

40
00:02:42.388 --> 00:02:49.572
Danny: If it’s Tristay, I’m ready to fight.

41
00:02:49.573 --> 00:02:53.236
Danny: Bello! What are you doing here?

42
00:02:53.237 --> 00:03:04.975
Tina: Bello, you shouldn’t be here.

43
00:03:04.976 --> 00:03:13.104
Tristay: None of you should be here!

44
00:03:13.105 --> 00:03:15.286
Danny: I’ll get you, Tristay!

45
00:03:15.287 --> 00:03:17.263
Where are you?

46
00:03:17.264 --> 00:03:20.193
Tina: Yeah! Show your face!

47
00:03:20.194 --> 00:03:25.333
Tristay: Oh, I’ll show you my face all right.

48
00:03:25.334 --> 00:03:31.257
You’re coming to me!
